            "review_title": "Review at Chilli Thai Thiso Mall Sala",
            "review_text": "Danh Đ\n2 contributions\n0\nNếu bạn là tín đồ của ẩm thực Thái Lan – nơi kết hợp tuyệt vời giữa vị chua, cay, mặn, ngọt – thì Chilli Thái chắc chắn\nOct 2025 • Family\n• Pad Thai was perfectly cooked: soft noodles, fresh shrimp, and a flavorful sweet-and-sour sauce.\n • Tom Yum Goong, the famous Thai hot and sour soup, was bursting with flavors – spicy, sour, and aromatic with lemongrass and chili.\n • Green Curry Chicken had a creamy coconut base, rich but not greasy, and went perfectly with steamed jasmine rice.\n • For dessert, the Mango Sticky Rice was simply delicious – the mango was ripe and sweet, while the sticky rice was soft and fragrant with coconut milk.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nOverall, Chilli Thai Restaurant is a wonderful spot for anyone who loves authentic Thai food and a cozy atmosphere. Whether you come with fr\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 7, 2025",
